    key codificada, não os bytes do objeto`} en={`Workers; arrows worker → SQS ("poll") and SQS → worker ("event")
    — the worker pulls; the event carries metadata, including bucket +
    a URL-encoded key, not the object bytes`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Setas worker ↔ S3 originais ("GET original" / "bytes"), worker →
    S3 versões ("grava versões") e worker → DB ("status + metadados");
    depois seta pontilhada worker → SQS ("DeleteMessage") — sem
    delete, retry após o timeout de visibilidade e, no limite,
    DLQ`} en={`Arrows worker ↔ S3 originals ("GET original" / "bytes"), worker →
    S3 versions ("writes versions"), and worker → DB ("status +
    metadata"); then dashed arrow worker → SQS ("DeleteMessage") — no
    delete means retry after the visibility timeout and eventually the
    DLQ`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
